-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code

lib_motors.ts
    The I2C protocol for the Nezha V2 smart motors is based on
    elecfreaks/pxt-nezha2 (https://github.com/elecfreaks/pxt-nezha2),
    MIT License, Copyright (c) ELECFREAKS.

lib_sensors_tof.ts
    The VL53L1X initialisation and ranging sequence follows the Pololu
    VL53L1X Arduino library (https://github.com/pololu/vl53l1x-arduino),
    which is based on the VL53L1X API by STMicroelectronics. See that
    repository's LICENSE.txt for its license terms.
